# Everything under Interface/AddOns belongs to somebody else. Only our own
# addons are tracked, named one by one, so a newly installed third-party
# addon can never wander into a commit.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/EredarEngineering/
!/EredarEngineering_TreasuryTimeline/
!/EredarEngineering_CrestPlanner/

# Build artefacts, wherever they appear inside our addons.
luac.out
*.src.rock
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.o
*.obj
*.dll
*.so
*.exe
*.out
